      {
        "parameters": {
          "content": "## 1. Watch the inbox\nChecks Gmail every 5 minutes for new inbox messages not sent by me (`in:inbox -from:me`).\n\nA message counts as a lead reply when it is in a thread the Outreach workflow started, or comes from a lead's address. Everything else is ignored and never reaches the AI. Bounces are found by sender (mailer-daemon) and matched by the address quoted in the bounce.",
          "height": 560,
          "width": 920,
          "color": 4
        },
        "id": "68844f2c-dfac-4ddf-a18d-7a6f3619afe4",
        "name": "Sticky Note 27799b5f",
        "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
        "typeVersion": 1,
        "position": [
          144,
          -64
        ]
      },
      {
        "parameters": {
          "content": "## 2. Sort the reply\nBounces and replies that start with \"stop\" or \"unsubscribe\" are handled by rules, without AI.\n\nEverything else goes to OpenAI GPT-5.4 mini, which picks `interested`, `not_interested`, `out_of_office`, `unsubscribe` or `other` and writes a one-line summary. If the AI fails, the reply is filed as `other` so the sequence still stops.",
          "height": 980,
          "width": 880,
          "color": 6
        },
        "id": "9867f008-1d5d-4d2d-87b7-a4ca15ab2378",
        "name": "Sticky Note ef5b3862",
        "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
        "typeVersion": 1,
        "position": [
          1104,
          -64
        ]
      },
      {
        "parameters": {
          "content": "## 3. Update and alert\nOut-of-office: the status stays as it was, so follow-ups carry on. Unsubscribe: `unsubscribed`. Bounce: `bounced`. Anything else: `replied`, which ends the sequence.\n\nInterested replies also trigger an email alert with the summary, the reply and a link to the Gmail thread.",
          "height": 980,
          "width": 520,
          "color": 5
        },
        "id": "9672a11a-50af-4734-a878-4281c806507f",
        "name": "Sticky Note 8bd8f93c",
        "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
        "typeVersion": 1,
